    "notes": "Jupiter is placed on a CIRCULAR orbit (its real eccentricity of 0.048 is set to zero) so that L4 and L5 are exactly the equilateral points of the restricted circular three-body problem. The trojans are massless test particles: they feel gravity but exert none."
